Demo model (demo/)
  The Internet Banking System ("Big Bank plc") example is from the C4 model by Simon Brown.
  Element names, descriptions and relationships follow the example workspace in
  https://github.com/structurizr/structurizr (structurizr-export/src/test/resources/big-bank-plc.json),
  licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
  The demo extends that example with further systems, containers, components and data of our own
  (payments, fraud checks, notifications, monitoring); those additions are made-up examples.

File format
  architecture/workspace.json follows the Structurizr JSON schema
  (structurizr-json/structurizr.yaml in the same repository, Apache License 2.0).
